{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You came to document a remote mountain retreat near a quiet, secluded village with a secret no one talks about. It should have been simple: observe, record, and leave.\u00a0Now the night won\u2019t end, and it keeps calling, and they will do anything to keep it a secret. <br>But the old train near Nala Junction may be your only way out. Catch it before they catch you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Found-footage style horror</strong>, driven by atmosphere, tension, and isolation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore an abandoned, isolated retreat</strong> tangled in ritual.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect corrupted tapes and documents</strong> to uncover what they  truly want.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Run and fight</strong>: Use weapons, no stealth, no mercy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Light parkour: </strong>Escape before they catch you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slow-building sense of dread<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639770/extras/FoundFootage_Style.gif?t=1745822723\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639770/extras/Light_Parkour.gif?t=1745822723\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639770/extras/Creature.gif?t=1745822723\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639770/extras/Environment_shot.gif?t=1745822723\" /></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3639770?t=1745822723","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639770/680cf82b93f4f340bba736fb59268c4772d8160c/page_b